                        models that match PokeAPI's JSON structure.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 mb-2 text-[11px] text-gray-600 space-y-1">
                        <li><code>allPokemon</code> holds all 151 Pokemon, <code>filteredPokemon</code> after
                            search/filter</li>
                        <li><code>selectedPokemon</code> is the one shown in the detail modal (null when closed)</li>
                        <li><code>searchQuery</code> and <code>selectedType</code> track user's filter choices</li>
                        <li><code>CurrentPagePokemon</code> computed property for pagination</li>
                        <li>Data classes like <code>PokemonListItem</code> and <code>PokemonDetail</code> structure your
                            data</li>
